       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-FORMAL-REVIEW-AUDIT-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-FORMAL-AUDIT-DIMENSIONS.
           05  WS-DIM1-AXIOMATIC-SOUNDNESS PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DIM2-SUBJECT-REDUCTION   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DIM3-PROGRESS-TERMINATE  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DIM4-CONSTRUCTIVE-MATCH  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DIM5-STANDARDS-CONFORM   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-AUDIT-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-PEER-REVIEW-APPROVED     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-AUDIT-CODE         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-AUDIT-LOGICAL-SOUNDNESS.
           PERFORM 2000-AUDIT-OPERATIONAL-SEMANTICS.
           PERFORM 3000-AUDIT-CONSTRUCTIVE-ARTIFACTS.
           PERFORM 4000-SYNTHESIZE-REVIEW-VERDICT.
           GOBACK.
       1000-AUDIT-LOGICAL-SOUNDNESS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DIM1-AXIOMATIC-SOUNDNESS.
       2000-AUDIT-OPERATIONAL-SEMANTICS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DIM2-SUBJECT-REDUCTION.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DIM3-PROGRESS-TERMINATE.
       3000-AUDIT-CONSTRUCTIVE-ARTIFACTS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DIM4-CONSTRUCTIVE-MATCH.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DIM5-STANDARDS-CONFORM.
       4000-SYNTHESIZE-REVIEW-VERDICT.
           IF WS-DIM1-AXIOMATIC-SOUNDNESS = 1 AND
              WS-DIM2-SUBJECT-REDUCTION = 1 AND
              WS-DIM3-PROGRESS-TERMINATE = 1 AND
              WS-DIM4-CONSTRUCTIVE-MATCH = 1 AND
              WS-DIM5-STANDARDS-CONFORM = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-PEER-REVIEW-APPROVED
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-AUDIT-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-PEER-REVIEW-APPROVED
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-AUDIT-CODE.
